            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"result\">Result</h2>\n<h3 id=\"capital-chavand-pratap-died-there-in-1597\">\u2705 <code>Capital: Chavand; Pratap died there in 1597</code></h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: right;\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>turns</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sub-calls</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">3 (0 returned NOT FOUND)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>characters read</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">119,791 of 3,000,265</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>document coverage</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">3.99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>root context peak</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">**5,959 chars</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(0.199% of the corpus)**</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Drag the slice slider down. Below ~24,000 characters the window stops\nreaching the planted passage, hop 1 fails, the chain breaks \u2014 and the run\n<strong>abstains</strong> instead of inventing an answer.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Xref",
      "code_hash": "d249d76b9f56a0965f58349486287342",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"the-transcript\">The transcript</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Turn 1</strong></span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"mi\">180</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"language-text codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>REPL: 3000265\nANNALS AND ANTIQUITIES OF RAJASTHAN -- A COMPILED CHRONICLE\n\nRaja Man Singh of the Jhala house gave battle to the chief of Kumbhalmer, and the fact is confirmed by the inscription\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Turn 2</strong></span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">t</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Haldighati\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"Bhamashah\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"minister\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"treasury\"</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">hits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">m</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">finditer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lower</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lower</span><span class=\"p\">())]</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"si\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">12s</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\"> </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hits</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">4d</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\"> </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">hits</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"language-text codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>REPL: Haldighati      1 [450832]\nBhamashah       0 []\nminister        1 [450929]\ntreasury        1 [450860]\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Turn 3</strong></span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">m</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">r</span><span class=\"s2\">\"bhama\\s*shah\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"found at\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ans1</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">llm_query</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">\"Which minister restored Maharana Pratap's finances after Haldighati, \"</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">\"and what did his donation pay for?\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">20000</span><span class=\"p\">):</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"mi\">20000</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ans1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"language-teratermmacro codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nv\">REPL</span>:<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">found</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">450938</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">In</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">season</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">following</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">field</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Haldighati</span>,<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">when</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Rana</span><span class=\"err\">'s treasury stood exhausted and his captains had begun to disperse, the minister Bhama Shah came to him at Chulia and laid his whole accumulated fortune before him -- a sum reported by the bards as sufficient to maintain five and twenty thousand men for the space of twelve years. The Rana at first refused it.</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Turn 4</strong></span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">hits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">m</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">finditer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">r</span><span class=\"s2\">\"bhama\\s*shah\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Bhama Shah occurrences:\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">hits</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">j</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">hits</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ans2</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">llm_query</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">\"What seat or capital did Pratap Singh fix after recovering Mewar?\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">j</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">20000</span><span class=\"p\">):</span> <span class=\"n\">j</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"mi\">20000</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ans2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"language-teratermmacro codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nv\">REPL</span>:<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Bhama</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Shah</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">occurrences</span>:<span class=\"w\"> </span>[<span class=\"mi\">450938</span>,<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1352406</span>]\n<span class=\"nv\">His</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">seat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">during</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">this</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">period</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">was</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">fixed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Chavand</span>,<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">forty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">miles</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">south</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"nv\">east</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Udaipur</span>,<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Chavand</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">remained</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">capital</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Mewar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">remainder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">his</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">reign</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">whole</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">his</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">son</span><span class=\"err\">'s minority. Maharana Bida of the Rathore house made submission to the chief of Sirohi, though the bards differ upon the number.</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr />\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Turn 5</strong></span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">hits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">m</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">finditer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"chavand\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Chavand occurrences:\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">hits</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">k</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">hits</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ans3</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">llm_query</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"s2\">\"In what year did the Rana die at Chavand?\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">20000</span><span class=\"p\">):</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"mi\">20000</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ans3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"language-teratermmacro codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nv\">REPL</span>:<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Chavand</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">occurrences</span>:<span class=\"w\"> </span>[<span class=\"mi\">1352596</span>,<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1352668</span>,<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2554576</span>]\n<span class=\"nv\">At</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Chavand</span>,<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">fifty</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"nv\">seventh</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">year</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">his</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">age</span>,<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Rana</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">was</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">seized</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">an</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">internal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">injury</span><